      <chord name="G"/>Jesus, the <chord name="Am"/>ver<chord name="E"/>y <chord name="Am"/>thought <chord name="D"/>of <chord name="G"/>Thee<br/>
      <chord name="D7"/>With <chord name="G"/>sweet<chord name="D7"/>ness <chord name="G"/>fills <chord name="A7"/>the <chord name="D"/>breast;<br/>
